{"data": [{"author_id": "2014257062889271296", "created_at": "2026-11-08T05:09:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119296336713711974"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 138, "start": 134, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2119296336713711974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 112, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC doesn't need to manufacture DRAM cells to capture more value from HBM.\n\nThe reported 3D DRAM initiative remains unconfirmed. But $TSM  already has a more concrete role: advanced logic for HBM4 base dies and CoWoS packaging for AI accelerators.\n\nSK hynix has confirmed its", "url": "https://x.com/StragglerLiu/status/2119296336713711974"}, {"author_id": "1600530338920415232", "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:56:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119836484815487481"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MPlakhotnyuk/s…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MPlakhotnyuk/status/2119792430920921355", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/OiOsvbZeeb"}]}, "id": "2119836484815487481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 228, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119792430920921355", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A critical reminder from semiconductor physicist Dr. Maksym Plakhotnyuk on advanced packaging bottlenecks: cleanroom capacity reflects atomic process control rather than floor space.\n\nSell-side models assume building cleanrooms linearly doubles CoWoS and HBM output. Physical https://t.co/OiOsvbZeeb", "url": "https://x.com/LiDaosen/status/2119836484815487481"}, {"author_id": "1600530338920415232", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:56:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119776106668490787"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zerohedge/stat…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zerohedge/status/2119773393822323053", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/Ui8k3JWUr8"}]}, "id": "2119776106668490787", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2364, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119773393822323053", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Headlines framing Google new TPU systems as an Nvidia killer misunderstand hyperscaler workload segmentation and semiconductor physics:\n\nInternal Margin Defense vs Merchant Silicon: Google builds TPUs to protect Search and Gemini token inference unit economics. Outside of https://t.co/Ui8k3JWUr8", "url": "https://x.com/LiDaosen/status/2119776106668490787"}, {"author_id": "1128909671014604801", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:03:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119536398894252157"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MG1r2Lrc6D", "end": 204, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119536398894252157/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119536389364781056", "start": 181, "url": "https://t.co/MG1r2Lrc6D"}]}, "id": "2119536398894252157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"모리스 창의 '미국 공장은 헛수고'라는 경고를 비웃듯 수율 92%가 터졌습니다. 하지만 그 뒤엔 +28.5%라는 잔혹한 '미국산 프리미엄' 청구서가 붙었습니다.\"\n\n🇺🇸 TSMC 애리조나 Fab 21과 반도체 리쇼어링 4대 팩트\n\n1️⃣ 수율 92% 달성: 온갖 회의론을 뒤엎은 기술적 승리\n• 문화적 충돌, 노조 갈등, https://t.co/MG1r2Lrc6D", "url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119536398894252157"}, {"article": {"title": "産業構造分析#1-3 パッケージング：作ったチップをつなげず売れず、TSMCのあふれた注文はASEへ"}, "author_id": "2009110487250948100", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:51:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119805006501253531"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2119…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119804885789278209", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119804885789278209", "url": "https://t.co/VcHzelYPLo"}]}, "id": "2119805006501253531", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/VcHzelYPLo", "url": "https://x.com/koccr8861/status/2119805006501253531"}, {"author_id": "1128909671014604801", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:04:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119536592163586082"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9gNlPO9c3R", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119536592163586082/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119536585620541440", "start": 179, "url": "https://t.co/9gNlPO9c3R"}]}, "id": "2119536592163586082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"미국의 살인적인 제재 속에서도 화웨이가 AI 칩으로만 16조 원을 벌어들이고 있습니다. 하지만 그 화려한 숫자 뒤편엔 SMIC의 '30% 수율'이라는 눈물겨운 출혈이 숨어 있습니다.\"\n\n🇨🇳 화웨이 어센드 910C와 중국 반도체 자립 4대 팩트\n\n1️⃣ 엔비디아 H20 버리고 910C로: 120억 달러 매출 돌파\n• https://t.co/9gNlPO9c3R", "url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119536592163586082"}, {"author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-11-08T08:07:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119341141825102141"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8sRnNSKo9Q", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2119341141825102141/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119341138977214464", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/8sRnNSKo9Q"}]}, "id": "2119341141825102141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dossier IA/semi de la semaine (08–15 nov.) — catalyseurs à fort impact\n\n1) TSMC — ventes d’octobre attendues mardi 10/11 (AS/Taipei 13h30)\n\nTSMC publiera ses ventes mensuelles d’octobre le 10 novembre (13h30 à Taipei), baromètre direct des commandes 3/2 nm et du packaging CoWoS https://t.co/8sRnNSKo9Q", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2119341141825102141"}, {"article": {"title": "Foundry Outlook: AI Keeps Supply T