{"title": "HBM Is the Bottleneck. The Money Is Somewhere Else."}, "author_id": "2109210128146976768", "created_at": "2026-11-09T15:23:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119813084466323722"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2119…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119811926825881600", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119811926825881600", "url": "https://t.co/Ci3hxOsq7Z"}]}, "id": "2119813084466323722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Ci3hxOsq7Z", "url": "https://x.com/Rubys_MoneyFlow/status/2119813084466323722"}, {"article": {"title": "What It Takes to Make an NVIDIA-Class Chip, and Where China’s Toolchain Stands"}, "author_id": "1440376299504107523", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:47:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119577618039058934"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2119…", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119576106755846144", "start": 222, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119576106755846144", "url": "https://t.co/VWByJ33F9q"}]}, "id": "2119577618039058934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can China buy the machines needed to rival NVIDIA's chips? The answer runs through ASML's lithography tools, TSMC's manufacturing expertise, and the less visible challenges of yield, memory, packaging and export controls. https://t.co/VWByJ33F9q", "url": "https://x.com/BHIIKTOR/status/2119577618039058934"}, {"author_id": "1135464389027385344", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:45:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119803662214262840"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3qr05U50tS", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/qiyuancommunity/status/2119803662214262840/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119803652542263296", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/3qr05U50tS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/3qr05U50tS", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/qiyuancommunity/status/2119803662214262840/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119803652529614848", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/3qr05U50tS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/3qr05U50tS", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/qiyuancommunity/status/2119803662214262840/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119803652626137088", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/3qr05U50tS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/3qr05U50tS", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/qiyuancommunity/status/2119803662214262840/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119803652571549696", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/3qr05U50tS"}]}, "id": "2119803662214262840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 168, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一文读懂2026年AI智能硬件产业链（附研报） https://t.co/3qr05U50tS", "url": "https://x.com/qiyuancommunity/status/2119803662214262840"}, {"author_id": "1049239807090520064", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:28:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119753969174024579"], "id": "2119753969174024579", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "黄仁勋这次的事，真正该担心的不是绯闻，是英伟达的「单点故障」。\n\n先把事实和指控分开：\n\n已确认：老黄在内部信里承认对妻子不忠，英伟达董事会启动独立调查，董事会称「没有理由认为国家安全或公司机密受损」，他调查期间继续当 CEO。盘前股价跌了大约 5%。\n\n未证实：NYT/FT", "url": "https://x.com/omnigeeker/status/2119753969174024579"}, {"author_id": "501724400", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:19:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119751657458155641"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 254, "start": 249, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/b0w5wWl42s", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GianMassimoUsai/status/2119751657458155641/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119751490541637632", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/b0w5wWl42s"}]}, "id": "2119751657458155641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 254, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ieri sono successe decine di cose sui mercati. Ma se tolgo il rumore, secondo me ce ne sono tre che contano davvero.\n\nPer Nvidia il caso Jensen Huang non è più gossip. È diventato un problema di governance e sicurezza nazionale.\n\nNel weekend Nvidia $NVDA ha annunciato che il https://t.co/b0w5wWl42s", "url": "https://x.com/GianMassimoUsai/status/2119751657458155641"}, {"author_id": "445794221", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:51:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119790066486661262"], "id": "2119790066486661262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI chips are only as fast as the package holding them. Advanced packaging is a 48.39 billion dollar market in 2026, growing 9.2 percent a year, as TSMC reports CoWoS capacity booked through late 2026. Every accelerator needs one. Own the suppliers packaging the chips.", "url": "https://x.com/chris_salerno_/status/2119790066486661262"}, {"author_id": "1482283068555546627", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:17:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119766306400702826"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Afs3aWI0dy", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ricci_nov/status/2119766306400702826/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119766303246618624", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/Afs3aWI0dy"}]}, "id": "2119766306400702826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Per The Information, TSMC is exploring cell-stacked 3D DRAM at Nvidia's request. Today TSMC builds HBM4 base dies and CoWoS packaging, not memory cells. If it happens, TSMC would compete directly with Samsung, SK hynix and Micron. No timeline, no TSMC confirmation. https://t.co/Afs3aWI0dy", "url": "https://x.com/ricci_nov/status/2119766306400702826"}, {"author_id": "1683281560890494976", "created_at": "2026-11-08T15:44:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119455972993188335"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/blueplanet223/…", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/blueplanet223/status/2119300726954594596", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/cbitNpp6ak"}]}, "id": "2119455972993188335", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 454, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119300726954594596", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Election ploy or not: Contract Manufacturing Rule #1 = De-risking the whale: TSMC dropping $60B+ a year in capex spend for 2nm and CoWoS. One customer at 60% CoWoS = too much concentration. https://t.co/cbitNpp6ak", "url": "https://x.com/donaldgorbachev/status/2119455972993188335"}, {"author_id": "1791161179189936128", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:48:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119426839588290785"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 258, "start": 255, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 274, "start": 259, "tag": "Semiconductors"}, {"end": 282, "start": 275, "tag": "Nvidia"}]}, "id": "2119426839588290785", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚡️ New AI bottleneck: CoWoS chip packaging.\nTSMC capacity limits risk Nvidia &amp; AMD supplies. The fix: multi-billion dollar investments in partners (ASE Group) and multi-chip integration.\nAI speed now depends on assembly quality, not just core power. \n#AI #Semiconductors #Nvidia", "url": "https://x.com/anonimus666678/status/2119426839588290785"}, {"author_id": "1838071667941343232", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:00:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119580856310431857"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 127, "start": 109, "tag": "AdvancedPackaging"}, {"end": 137, "start": 128, "tag": "Chiplets"}, {"end": 141, "start": 138, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 148, "start": 142, "tag": "CoWoS"}, {"end": 154, "start": 149, "tag": "SoIC"}, {"end": 160, "start": 155, "tag": "TSMC"}], "urls": [{"description": "Why break monolithic dies? Explore chiplet pivot, 2D/3D integration trade-offs (CoWoS, SoIC), thermal constraints, and how AMD MI300 series combines both", "display_url": "chipress.online/2026/11/08/the…", "end": 106, "expanded_url": "https://chipress.online/2026/11/08/the-chiplet-shift-from-silicon-scaling-to-packaging-innovation-in-ai-accelerators/", "images": [{"height": 357, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119580857023479808/NWh6fVBl?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 640}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119580857023479808/NWh6fVBl?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 83, "status": 200, "title": "The Chiplet Shift: Beyond Monoliths for AI Accelerator Scaling", "unwound_url": "http://chipress.online/2026/11/08/the-chiplet-shift-from-silicon-scaling-to-packaging-innovation-in-ai-accelerators/", "url": "https://t.co/fvDxAu5HaE"}]}, "id": "2119580856310431857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Chiplet Shift: From Silicon Scaling to Packaging Innovation in AI Accelerators https://t.co/fvDxAu5HaE \n\n#AdvancedPackaging #Chiplets #AI #CoWoS #SoIC #TSMC", "url": "https://x.com/chipressacademy/status/2119580856310431857"}, {"author_id": "2040579454536445952", "created_at": "2026-11-09T14:07:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119793959325307192"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 203, "id": "317150782", "start": 192, "username": "IanCutress"}, {"end": 212, "id": "19663365", "start": 204, "username": "sallywf"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GMrCaF6MWZ", "end": 236, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/leopoldriskmgmt/status/2119793959325307192/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119793938999418880", "start": 213, "url": "https://t.co/GMrCaF6MWZ"}]}, "id": "2119793959325307192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 455, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Google new TPU 8i Max joins two 8i TPUs for twice the compute, SRAM, and HBM. Curious how they connect them either with a bridge in substrate or mount them both on a giant Cowos-l interposer. @IanCutress @sallywf https://t.co/GMrCaF6MWZ", "url": "https://x.com/leopoldriskmgmt/status/2119793959325307192"}, {"author_id": "1769051162169561089", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:35:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119770737418686626"], "id": "2119770737418686626", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "这一轮 AI 硬件里，最被低估的环节是先进封装。HBM 堆得再高，最后都要过 CoWoS 那道关，产能排不上就只能干等。设计能力再强，也要老老实实排在产能后面。", "url": "https://x.com/hajiMVP/status/2119770737418686626"}, {"author_id": "1653831727880478726", "created_at": "2026-11-08T12:42:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119410320816930946"], "id": "2119410320816930946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI chips are becoming packaging systems. TSMC lists 5.5-reticle-size CoWoS for 2026 volume production. Reuters (Nov. 6) reports packaging capacity remains a constraint. Watch qualified output and yields—not just transistor counts. NFA.", "url": "https://x.com/MegatrendMaster/status/2119410320816930946"}, {"author_id": "1975518700817293313", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:12:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119568789683769831"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 103, "id": "1975518700817293313", "start": 87, "username": "Semiconductorge"}], "urls": [{"description": "100字要約 TSMCのCoWoSが供給逼迫するなか、Intelの先端パッケージ技術EMIB-Tに注目が集まる。GoogleやAmazonのAIチップへの採用観測に加え、将来は70個超のブリッジを搭載する大型パッケージも視野に入る。 キーワード（5つ） 